 "library": {
  "title": "Freestanding oven cooker 600x600x900",
  "description": "Black freestanding cooker, 600 x 600 x 900. It has an oven door with a tinted glass window, a bar handle, five knobs, a storage drawer and a four-ring hob on top (two large rings, two small). Its origin is the back-left-bottom corner and the front faces -Y.",
